                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": ") Western blots probed with α-Myc for Ddc2-9xMyc and Ddc2-9xMyc-AID in a 1-DSB and 2-DSB, respectively. α-Pgk1 is used as a loading control. ("
                      }
