              "label": "6—figure supplement 3",
              "labelAutomatically": false,
              "caption": [
                {
                  "type": "Paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "Strong",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "Text",
                          "value": {
                            "string": "Degradation of Ddc2 and Mad2 at 15 hr releases cells from checkpoint arrest. "
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": "("
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Strong",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "Text",
                          "value": {
                            "string": "A"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": ") Morphological profile of a 2-DSB "
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Emphasis",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "Text",
                          "value": {
                            "string": "MAD2-AID"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": " and "
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Emphasis",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "Text",
                          "value": {
                            "string": "DDC2-AID MAD2-AID"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": " strains after HO induction. Cultures were added onto YEP-Gal ± IAA plates 15 hr after adding HO induction. Ctrl samples were plated on a YEP-Gal plate and IAA samples were plated on a YEP-GAL-IAA plate. Western blot probed with α-Rad53 and α-Myc. α-Rad53 shows both an unphosphorylated protein and multiple phosphorylated species. α-Myc shows Ddc2-AID Mad2-AID degradation and TIR1-Myc as a loading control. ("
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Strong",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "Text",
                          "value": {
                            "string": "B"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": ") Profile of DAPI-stained cells in a 2-DSB "
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Emphasis",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "Text",
                          "value": {
                            "string": "DDC2-AID MAD2-AID"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": {
                        "string": " strain after HO induction. Cultures were split 15 hr after HO induction and treated with either IAA or ethanol. Cells were divided based on cell morphology and number of DAPI signals."
                      }
                    }
